    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Talora Carved Glass Decanter | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Talora carved glass decanter by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its geometric clear glass, sculptural stopper and light-catching vintage-inspired character."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/tableware">Tableware</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Talora Carved Glass Decanter</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/tableware/kave-home-talora-carved-glass-decanter.png"
            alt="Talora carved clear glass decanter by Kave Home styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BARWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Talora Carved Glass Decanter
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Kave Home
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A substantial clear-glass decanter shaped by geometric carving
            and finished with a sculptural square stopper. The faceted surface
            catches and multiplies the light, giving this practical barware
            piece the presence of a decorative object.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>100% Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>80 cl</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>21 × 10 × 10 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>1.57 kg</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Clear</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Geometric carved glass</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/talara-bottle-made-from-clear-carved-glass-80-cl?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Talora turns something functional into an object worth leaving
            on display. Its substantial square silhouette, architectural
            carving and oversized glass stopper give it the character of
            vintage barware, while the completely clear finish keeps the
            overall look clean and contemporary.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like the way the geometric surface catches changing
            light. Filled with an amber-toned drink, the carved glass becomes
            even more expressive, making it an easy centrepiece for a drinks
            tray, dining room cabinet or relaxed evening table.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep the glass beautifully clear</h2>

        <p>
          Kave Home recommends cleaning the decanter with a damp cloth and
          mild cleaner, then drying it immediately. Dust with a soft duster
          when needed. The piece is fragile and is not listed as dishwasher
          or microwave safe.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Amber Tones</h3>
            <p>
              Cognac, whisky or another amber-toned drink brings warmth to
              the clear carved glass and makes every facet more visible.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Warm Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Place it on travertine, marble or a warm stone tray to balance
              the crisp geometry of the glass with a softer natural texture.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Vintage Glassware</h3>
            <p>
              Pair it with weighty tumblers or subtly patterned glasses for
              a collected bar setting that feels elegant rather than formal.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>TABLEWARE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/tableware/alori-amber-champagne-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-alori-amber-cava-glass.png"
                alt="Alori Amber Champagne Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Alori Amber Champagne Glass</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/tableware/cristal-darques-lady-diamond-wine-glasses"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/cristal-darques-lady-diamond-wine-glasses.png"
                alt="Lady Diamond Wine Glasses"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Lady Diamond Wine Glasses</h3>
              <p>Cristal D'Arques</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME · TALORA
        </p>

        <h2>
          Clear glass with a little more character.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/talara-bottle-made-from-clear-carved-glass-80-cl?utm_affaid=kasodi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>